# A class reached from a root, defined in a header that two files include.
# Under --e2e, recurse-persistent must specialise it once: one ClangTool for
# both files used to work from the header's old text in the second file and
# splice a second specialisation into it.
header: pmem_ptr<persistent<Counter>> visits;
in b.cpp: return __pers_get_root()->visits->hits;
out: hits {n} b {n}
